{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分叙事句压缩得较短，人物情绪转变的因果和背景交代不如Y完整，尤其是离开后的孤独感及不愿回头的原因。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点加亮让观众能迅速抓住每段核心，感受文字按音乐节点出现，也避免了大量短词同时堆在屏幕上；音乐变化、身体反应和情绪转折的对应更细腻具体。Y的完整叙述更自然地交代了人物为什么产生这些矛盾，以及前后情绪如何相互推动，但右侧感受词较容易形成信息堆积。综合边听边扫的实际体验，我选X，尽管它牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "223a7802-501e-49ff-9149-b31dca1c12d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163945495017Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:41:30.809273+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d158cbb17a083f17d777035191ef80e475f83fbd251c44fd1c0a094df522230f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e